      "created_at": "2024-09-06T14:30:27.776Z",
      "resolved_at": null,
      "message": "Options 2 and 3 resonate with me: \n* Option 2's link could be measurable which is really useful info to know\n* I do like a bit of context with Option 2. Without it, it could be seen as spam\n* Option 3 is nice because we're still promoting Firefox and it focuses attention on the first link sent (vs. possibly confusing/annoying ppl with 2 links)\n* The biggest downside for Option 3 is not being able to measure CTR",
